- Import bank statements.
- Upload CSV bank transaction files.
- Record bank statement balances.
- Match bank transactions to book entries.
- Identify unmatched transactions.
- Identify bank charges.
- Identify bank interest.
- Identify outstanding cheques.
- Identify deposits in transit.
- Identify duplicate transactions.
- Record approved reconciliation adjustments.

Show:
- Bank statement balance.
- Adjustments for deposits in transit.
- Adjustments for outstanding payments.
- Adjusted bank balance.
- Cash book bank balance.
- Book adjustments.
